      "writtenOn": "2023-10-03T23:47:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think int_accel handles this already.\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/main/driver/accel_lis2dw12.c#50\n```\nlis2dw12_config_interrupt(const struct motion_sensor_t *s)\n{\n...\n\t/* Enable interrupt on FIFO watermark and route to int1. */\n\tRETURN_ERROR(st_write_data_with_mask(s, LIS2DW12_INT1_FTH_ADDR,\n\t\t\t\t\t     LIS2DW12_INT1_FTH_MASK,\n\t\t\t\t\t     LIS2DW12_EN_BIT));\n...\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "1cbbf0fd_a4c9e675",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 255,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 255,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "25a67ddb4494cdd43f113e61bf92bf639e7d02aa",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "56285bbc_410e9d16",
        "filename": "zephyr/dts/program/rex/motionsense.dtsi",
